<title>TAIWAN: First Int'l Jan-Sept net up 91 pct.</title>
<headline>First Int'l Jan-Sept net up 91 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     20,165 vs 17,387</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 1,028 vs    605</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1,011 vs    529</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (single T$)    1.87 vs   1.19</p>
<p>NOTE - First International Computer Inc is Taiwan's second largest computer firm. The firm has set a 1996 pretax profit target of T$1.21 billion on sales of T$30 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
